@testray.main.component.name = "Patcher Builder"

Feature: Patcher Builder and 72 fixpack
	Testing creation of 72 fixpack on Patcher Builder.

Setup:
	* I go to the Patcher Builder Jenkins homepage

Scenario: Run fix pack builder fixpack 7x job
	As a TSE, I should be able to run the fixpack-builder-hotfix-7x job

